These comments are based on the nethack.alt.org tournament which has
just finished, but the devnull tournament may have the same bugs.

The following deaths listed on
http://sartak.katron.org/nh/tourney/uniquedeaths.txt are completely
impossible to achieve:

.* with a fake Amulet
The game message has "with a fake Amulet" in brackets.

using a magical horn on (him|her)self
The correct message is "killed by using a magical horn on
(him|her)self".

poisoned by a poisoned blast
poisoned by a fall onto poison spikes
There is a comment in mon.c that "Poisoned by a poisoned ___" is
redundant, which makes these deaths impossible.  During the
tournament, I was killed by deadly poison on poison spikes and the
death message was "killed by a fall onto poison spikes".

I believe that the first two deaths have been fixed on nao, but not
the second two as far as I know.
